        "node_id": "n_18_4658c2",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous code was that it was not updating the max_difference correctly. Instead of initializing max_difference to negative infinity and then finding the maximum difference, we should initialize it to negative infinity and update it only when we find a box that is big enough (difference >= 0). This way, if no box is big enough, we'll still return negative infinity as the correct answer.",
